  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe buttons used on the VRC+ Leaderboard do not match the styling that is usually used by VRChat's menu in e.g. the settings menu.\n\nThis affects the following buttons:\n\n- \"Appear as Anonymous\" / \"Undo\"\n\n- \"Gift Drop in Instance\"\n\n- \"Gift a Friend\"\n\n- \"<\" / \">\" (buttons to switch pages)\n\n# Expected Behaviour / Design\n\nThe listed buttons should be brought in line with the overall VRChat menu design for better visual consistency and usability:\n\n- **Sizing:** The buttons are currently too small and should be increased in size for improved readability and interaction.\n\n- **Font:** The current font does not use the standard bold typeface and should be updated.\n\n- **Background:** Button backgrounds are inconsistent, some buttons have a background while others do not. All buttons should use a consistent background style.\n\n- **Border:** Buttons are missing the typical VRChat styling, which includes a lighter outer border with a darker inner fill. This should be implemented consistently across all buttons.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere are a few screenshots comparing the Leaderboard buttons with the rest of VRChat's UI:",
